Scope of this license

In this repository, "the Software" means only the original code, scripts,
configuration, and theme files. That includes colors, palettes, QML, the
installer, documentation text, and original graphics that do not depict a
character. The abstract flame frames and flat interface graphics listed in
ASSETS-LICENSE are part of the Software.

This license does not apply to character artwork. It does not grant any right
in the character Aura or in Frieren: Beyond Journey's End. Those rights stay
with their holders.

Images that depict Aura are provided for personal, non-commercial fan use
only. They were generated with OpenAI's GPT image generation. They are not
relicensable under this license or any other license offered here. The Aura
Symbols font is excluded as well, because one of its glyphs depicts Aura.

The excluded paths, the fan-use terms, and the non-character graphics that
remain under this license are listed in ASSETS-LICENSE. Third-party components
keep the license notices stored beside them.

The agent skill copies this file. The skill bundle itself contains only
Software: the palette, the Kitty preset, scripts, and skill docs. It does not
contain the excluded artwork.
